</figure>
</section>
<section id="A4.SS4" class="ltx_subsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">D.4 </span>More experiment results</h4>

<div id="A4.SS4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.SS4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">All text generation tasks were conducted on NVIDIA A100 GPUs, with a total computational cost of approximately 360 GPU hours to reproduce all experiments.
Here, we present the results of additional experiments that were not included in the main content.
Table <a href="#A4.T9" title="Table 9 ‣ D.4 More experiment results ‣ Appendix D Experiment Details and Results ‣ Appendices ‣ On the Empirical Power of Goodness-of-Fit Tests in Watermark Detection" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a> provides a list of additional results along with brief descriptions.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A4.T9" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 9: </span>List of additional results.</figcaption>
<table id="A4.T9.5" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="A4.T9.5.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A4.T9.5.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_tt" style="padding:1.4pt 4.0pt;">
